              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_4_table_4.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>Class interval</td><td>Number of students (f<sub>i</sub>)</td><td>Class mark (x<sub>i</sub>)</td><td>d<sub>i</sub> = x<sub>i</sub> - 47.5</td><td>f<sub>i</sub>d<sub>i</sub></td></tr><tr><td>10 - 25</td><td>2</td><td>17.5</td><td>-30</td><td>-60</td></tr><tr><td>25 - 40</td><td>3</td><td>32.5</td><td>-15</td><td>-45</td></tr><tr><td>40 - 55</td><td>7</td><td>47.5</td><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>55 - 70</td><td>6</td><td>62.5</td><td>15</td><td>90</td></tr><tr><td>70 - 85</td><td>6</td><td>77.5</td><td>30</td><td>180</td></tr><tr><td>85 - 100</td><td>6</td><td>92.5</td><td>45</td><td>270</td></tr><tr><td>Total</td><td>Σf<sub>i</sub> = 30</td><td></td><td></td><td>Σf<sub>i</sub>d<sub>i</sub> = 435</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.454,
            0.723,
            0.499
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, from Table 13.4, the mean of the deviations, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\bar{d} = \\frac{\\Sigma f_{i}d_{i}}{\\Sigma f_{i}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.512,
            0.609,
            0.531
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, let us find the relation between "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\overline { d }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\overline { { x } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.532,
            0.9,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Since in obtaining "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "d _ { i ^ { * } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " we subtracted "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "^ { \\circ } a ^ { \\prime }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " from each "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "x _ { i ^ { \\flat } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " so, in order to get the mean x , we need to add "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "^ { \\circ } a ^ { \\prime }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " to "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\overline { d }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . This can be explained mathematically as:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.605,
            0.344,
            0.625
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Mean of deviations,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.591,
            0.55,
            0.638
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_4_equation_9.jpg",
          "content": "\\frac{\\Sigma f_{i}}{\\Sigma f_{i}}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.659,
            0.193,
            0.678
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.436,
            0.644,
            0.617,
            0.813
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_4_equation_11.jpg",
          "content": "\\begin{aligned}\\overline{\\overline{d}} &= \\frac{\\Sigma f_{i}\\left( x_{i} - a \\right)}{\\Sigma f_{i}} \\\\&= \\frac{\\Sigma f_{i}x_{i}}{\\Sigma f_{i}} - \\frac{\\Sigma f_{i}a}{\\Sigma f_{i}} \\\\&= \\overline{x} - a\\frac{\\Sigma f_{i}}{\\Sigma f_{i}} \\\\&= \\overline{x} - a\\end{aligned}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.824,
            0.135,
            0.843
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.439,
            0.817,
            0.554,
            0.843
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_4_equation_13.jpg",
          "content": "\\left[ \\overline { { x } }   =   a + \\dot { \\overline { { d } } } \\right]"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.866,
            0.139,
            0.884
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "i.e.,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.439,
            0.851,
            0.588,
            0.896
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_4_equation_15.jpg",
          "content": "\\left\\{ \\overline { { x } } \\; = \\; a + \\frac { \\Sigma f _ { i } d _ { i } } { \\Sigma f _ { i } } \\right."
        },
